# Frontend — Vite environment variables
# Copy to .env for local development (this file is ignored by Git).
# VITE_ prefix is required for Vite to expose the variable to client code.
#
# Local: leave empty or set to http://localhost:8080 to use the dev proxy
#        defined in vite.config.ts (proxy /api → http://localhost:8080).
# Production (Render Static Site): set to the public backend URL.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://mystery-shopper-api.onrender.com

# Optional — overrides the Vite base path (defaults to /).
# BASE_PATH=/
